* lna-a2-current-reuse: current-reuse NMOS/PMOS push-pull CS LNA.
* Lineage: Karanicolas, "A 2.7-V 900-MHz CMOS LNA and Mixer", JSSC 1996 /
* inverter-LNA (current-reuse) lineage. Bench-v1 anchor; verbatim of the
* proven v0.2 external c3 (round-1 external, wl 226544590d47717b, 6/24 gf180
* topology credit). Structure-only, ZERO component values. Published BIAS
* NETWORKS in-topology: NMOS gate via mirror ref R1 -> diode NM3 through R2;
* PMOS gate via diode PM2 (current set by R4) through R5; tuned load L2+C2
* off the shared DC path; input DC-blocked (C4).
* Approved 2026-09-14 (bench round 1, "approve all").
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n2 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
PMOS PM2 n6 n6 VDD VDD
R R4 n6 VSS
R R5 n6 n3
